        <mxCell id="140" value="&lt;b&gt;Updated after the 19 Sep review&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#8226; One unified LEADERBOARD for daily quizzes and exams; split by scope (global vs friends) instead of by activity.&lt;br&gt;&#8226; USERS &#8594; LEADERBOARD directly; FRIENDS is a user-to-user link (user_id / friend_id), not a child of LEADERBOARD.&lt;br&gt;&#8226; QUIZ QUESTION BANK: quiz questions are derived from exam QUESTIONS (source_question_id) but re-levelled, never copied.&lt;br&gt;&#8226; Daily quiz = 10-15 multiple-choice questions only.&lt;br&gt;&#8226; Difficulty rises with the streak (streak_at_start, difficulty_step, level)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#000000;dashed=1;fillColor=none;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1300" width="460" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
